### secret-cache-lab — ScriptBase secret cache (in-process + TTL) elle deneme
### Otomatik senaryo: api-tests/secret-cache-lab/secret-cache-behaviour-test.py

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = secret-cache-lab
@instanceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Start instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "testId": "secretlab-manual"
}

### Probe — ayni secret'i 3 kez okur, her okumanin suresini instance data'ya yazar.
### Cevaptaki attributes.microsPerRead: [soguk, sicak, sicak] beklenir (ilk okuma ms, digerleri us).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/probe-secret?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{}

### Instance data (probeRound / secretValue / readAtUtc / microsPerRead)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/data
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### State
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Finish
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/finish-lab?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{}

### Vault'taki degeri degistirmek icin (host'tan):
### docker exec vnext-vault sh -c 'VAULT_ADDR=http://127.0.0.1:8200 VAULT_TOKEN=admin \
###   vault kv put -mount=secret workflow-secret ApiSecret=YENI-DEGER'
### Degisiklikten sonra TTL (varsayilan 30 sn) dolana kadar probe ESKI degeri dondurur.
